<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pagina no encontrada | CmDesign</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #0f0f0f;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .container-404 {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .logo-404 {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .logo-404 img {
            height: 40px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .error-visual {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .error-code {
            font-size: clamp(100px, 20vw, 180px);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .error-code::before {
            content: '404';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53935 0%, #ff6b6b 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 50%, 0 50%);
            animation: glitch 2s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes glitch {
            0%, 100% { clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 50%, 0 50%); }
            25% { clip-path: polygon(0 20%, 100% 20%, 100% 70%, 0 70%); }
            50% { clip-path: polygon(0 40%, 100% 40%, 100% 90%, 0 90%); }
            75% { clip-path: polygon(0 10%, 100% 10%, 100% 60%, 0 60%); }
        }
        
        .hanger {
            position: absolute;
            top: -30px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 60px;
            height: 30px;
        }
        
        .hanger svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            stroke: #e53935;
            fill: none;
        }
        
        .tshirt-icon {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 3rem;
            opacity: 0.1;
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        .tshirt-1 { top: -20%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .tshirt-2 { top: 30%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 1s; }
        .tshirt-3 { bottom: 10%; left: 15%; animation-delay: 2s; }
        
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(5deg); }
        }
        
        .error-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #e53935;
        }
        
        .error-message {
            color: #9e9e9e;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .error-message strong {
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .error-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .btn-404 {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: #e53935;
            color: white;
            border: none;
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #f44336;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(229, 57, 53, 0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: #e53935;
            color: #e53935;
        }
        
        .bg-pattern {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.02;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='1'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        }
        
        .tagline {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .error-title {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            
            .error-actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .btn-404 {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-pattern"></div>
    
    <div class="tshirt-icon tshirt-1">👕</div>
    <div class="tshirt-icon tshirt-2">👔</div>
    <div class="tshirt-icon tshirt-3">🧥</div>
    
    <div class="container-404">
        <div class="logo-404">
            <img src="/img/logo_cmdesign_white.svg" alt="CmDesign">
        </div>
        
        <div class="error-visual">
            <div class="hanger">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 60 30" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M30 5 L30 0"/>
                    <path d="M5 25 Q5 15 15 12 L30 5 L45 12 Q55 15 55 25"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="error-code">404</div>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="error-title">Prenda no encontrada</h1>
        
        <p class="error-message">
            Parece que esta prenda ya no esta en nuestro catalogo o nunca existio.<br>
            Pero no te preocupes, <strong>estamos resolviendo esto</strong>.
        </p>
        
        <div class="error-actions">
            <a href="/" class="btn-404 btn-primary">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
                    <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/>
                </svg>
                Inicio
            </a>
            <a href="/catalogo" class="btn-404 btn-secondary">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/>
                    <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/>
                </svg>
                Ver Catalogo
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <p class="tagline">Moda urbana con actitud</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
